00:10:39.239 --> 00:10:42.108
Life expectancy is only 29.1 years

00:10:42.108 --> 00:10:44.043
Lived 4 years less

00:10:44.043 --> 00:10:45.645
Would you like to live 4 years less?

00:10:45.645 --> 00:10:47.113
don't want

00:10:47.113 --> 00:10:49.015
You probably still want to live to 120

00:10:49.015 --> 00:10:50.250
with the one you love, right?

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:50.750
yes

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:51.751
Research shows

00:10:51.751 --> 00:10:54.621
Those who desperately eat a low-sugar diet

00:10:54.621 --> 00:10:57.490
People who replace rice with meat and cheese.

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:00.093
Instead, blood fat soars

00:11:00.093 --> 00:11:02.328
Increased cardiovascular risk

00:11:02.328 --> 00:11:03.997
Higher chance of premature death

00:11:03.997 --> 00:11:06.833
So don't talk nonsense.

00:11:06.833 --> 00:11:08.001
Rice shouldn’t be cut off carelessly;

00:11:08.001 --> 00:11:09.469
eating rice in moderation is the key

00:11:09.469 --> 00:11:12.572
to living a long and healthy life.

